    "Kathlender reads your Shifts from your calendar and sets the right alarms. No more re-setting alarms by hand.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kathlender liest deine Dienste aus deinem Kalender und stellt die passenden Wecker. Nie wieder Wecker von Hand umstellen."
