    },
    "Rings on the Shift's date. Leave empty to ring nothing.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Klingelt am Tag des Dienstes. Leer lassen, damit nichts klingelt."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Save": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sichern"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Set up your Shift Types in Settings to plan Shifts.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Richte deine Dienstarten in den Einstellungen ein, um Dienste zu planen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Settings": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Einstellungen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Shift Types": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dienstarten"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Shifts": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dienste"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Shifts are all-day events titled with a Shortcut like “td” or “nd”. Kathlender only writes to your calendar when you plan a Shift.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dienste sind ganztägige Termine mit einem Kürzel wie „td“ oder „nd“ als Titel. Kathlender schreibt nur in deinen Kalender, wenn du einen Dienst planst."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Shifts are read from all-day events in these calendars.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dienste werden aus ganztägigen Terminen in diesen Kalendern gelesen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Shifts you plan on a day are written into this calendar.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dienste, die du an einem Tag planst, werden in diesen Kalender geschrieben."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Shortcut": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kürzel"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Shows this month": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Zeigt den aktuellen Monat"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Skip": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aussetzen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Skip Shift": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dienst aussetzen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Skip this Shift": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Diesen Dienst aussetzen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Status": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Status"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These all-day event titles match no Shift Type, so they ring nothing.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Diese Titel ganztägiger Termine passen zu keiner Dienstart, daher klingelt für sie nichts."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These all-day titles are in your chosen calendars. Name each one that is a Shift, and leave days off like “U” empty. Set their alarms later in Settings.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Diese ganztägigen Titel stehen in deinen ausgewählten Kalendern. Benenne jeden, der ein Dienst ist, und lass freie Tage wie „U“ leer. Ihre Wecker stellst du später in den Einstellungen ein."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This Shift can only be changed in the Calendar app.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dieser Dienst kann nur in der Kalender-App geändert werden."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This Shift is already on this day.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dieser Dienst ist an diesem Tag schon eingetragen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Today": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Heute"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tomorrow": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Morgen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Where are your Shifts?": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wo stehen deine Dienste?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your alarms stay as they were. Allow alarms in Settings.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Deine Wecker bleiben, wie sie sind. Erlaube Wecker in den Einstellungen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your alarms stay as they were. Allow full calendar access in Settings.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Deine Wecker bleiben, wie sie sind. Erlaube vollen Kalenderzugriff in den Einstellungen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your alarms stay as they were. Choose the calendars that hold your Shifts again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Deine Wecker bleiben, wie sie sind. Wähle die Kalender mit deinen Diensten erneut aus."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your chosen calendars have no all-day events yet. Add Shift Types later in Settings.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Deine ausgewählten Kalender enthalten noch keine ganztägigen Termine. Füge Dienstarten später in den Einstellungen hinzu."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your shift alarms may be out of date. Tap to check.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Deine Dienstwecker sind vielleicht veraltet. Tippe zum Prüfen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "e.g. Tagdienst": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "z. B. Tagdienst"
          }
        }
      }
    },
